		position: absolute;
		width: 27px;
		height: 27px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, #df97ba, #994e86);
		top: -33px;
		left: 13px;
		border: 1px solid #efb2cf;
		box-shadow: 2px 3px 4px #0005;
	}
	.button-pair {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
	}
